    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19049" root="سحت" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُحْتُوتٌ</span></b>  An <i>old and worn-out</i> garment or piece
of cloth; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحْتٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحْتِىٌّ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[A mess of] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوِيق</span> [or meal of parched barley, &amp;c.,]
<i>having little grease</i> or <i>gravy</i> [<i>mixed with it</i>];
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِحْتِيتٌ</span></b> ; (K;) the latter a dial. var. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِخْتِيتٌ</span> [q. v.]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And A desert (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفَازَةٌ</span>)
<i>of which the earth is soft.</i> (K.)

